# Python interpreter (glodon)

Run all Python in this repo with:

`C:\Users\hiroo\anaconda3\envs\glodon\python.exe`

Do not use `python`, `py`, Anaconda `base`, `dtsc670`, `dtsc680`, or
`C:\Users\hiroo\AppData\Local\Programs\Python\Python312\python.exe`.

```powershell
C:\Users\hiroo\anaconda3\envs\glodon\python.exe script.py
C:\Users\hiroo\anaconda3\envs\glodon\python.exe -m pip install -r requirements-flux2.txt
```

Install packages only with that interpreter's `-m pip`.
